      "text": "{\"story\":{\"as_a\":\"user\",\"i_want\":\"to view all my saved tasks in a task list on the to-do management page\",\"so_that\":\"I can see every task with its status and priority in one place\",\"business_description\":\"The to-do management page shows the task list. The system has a single user and no sign-in, so the list shows all stored tasks. Each task appears as one row with a status indicator and a priority indicator. The list shows a loading state, an empty state and an error state, and it refreshes automatically when a task is created, updated, deleted or has its status changed.\",\"business_value\":\"The user can see all tasks, their status and their priority without opening each task, and the list stays current after changes.\",\"acceptance_criteria\":[{\"given\":\"I have two or more saved tasks\",\"when\":\"I open the to-do management page\",\"then\":\"the task list shows every saved task, with one row per task\"},{\"given\":\"A task has the status Open and the priority High\",\"when\":\"the task list is displayed\",\"then\":\"that task's row shows a status indicator with the value Open and a priority indicator with the value High\"},{\"given\":\"The task list is waiting for the task data from the backend\",\"when\":\"the page is displayed\",\"then\":\"a loading state is shown in place of the task list until the data arrives\"},{\"given\":\"I have no saved tasks\",\"when\":\"the task list loads successfully\",\"then\":\"an empty state is shown and no task rows are displayed\"},{\"given\":\"The backend returns an error when the task list is requested\",\"when\":\"the task list loads\",\"then\":\"an error state is shown, no task rows are displayed, and the page does not show a successful state\"},{\"given\":\"The database is unavailable\",\"when\":\"the backend receives a request for all tasks\",\"then\":\"the backend returns an internal server error response and does not return any task data\"},{\"given\":\"A saved task with a known ID exists\",\"when\":\"the backend receives a request for that task by its ID\",\"then\":\"the backend returns that one task with its stored values\"},{\"given\":\"No saved task has the requested ID\",\"when\":\"the backend receives a request for that task by its ID\",\"then\":\"the backend returns a not-found error and does not return any task data\"},{\"given\":\"I am viewing the task list\",\"when\":\"a task is created, updated, deleted or has its status changed\",\"then\":\"the task list refreshes automatically and shows the change without a manual page reload\"},{\"given\":\"A create, update or delete action on a task has failed in the backend\",\"when\":\"the task list is refreshed\",\"then\":\"the list shows only the data the backend returns and does not show the failed change as saved\"}],\"edge_cases\":[\"A single saved task is shown as one row in the list.\",\"A task with the status In Progress or the priority Low or Medium is shown with the stored value in its indicator.\",\"There is no sign-in and no per-user filtering, so the list shows all stored tasks.\",\"The order of the rows in the list is not specified in the requirements.\",\"It is not specified what the list shows while a second refresh is still loading after a change.\",\"The success or error messages after create, update and delete actions are shown by the stories for those actions, not by the task list.\"],\"dependencies\":[\"US-create-task\",\"US-update-task\",\"US-delete-task\",\"US-change-task-status\"],\"definition_of_done\":[\"GET /tasks returns every stored task with its stored values.\",\"GET /tasks returns an internal server error and no task data when the database is unavailable.\",\"GET /tasks/{id} returns one task with its stored values when the ID exists.\",\"GET /tasks/{id} returns a not-found error and no task data when the ID does not exist.\",\"The task list shows one row per task with a status indicator and a priority indicator.\",\"The loading, empty and error states are shown as specified and tested.\",\"The task list refreshes after a task is created, updated, deleted or has its status changed, without a page reload.\",\"The task list displays only data returned by the backend and does not use optimistic updates.\",\"The task list test suite passes.\"]},\"tasks\":[{\"key_slug\":\"tasks-list-endpoint\",\"title\":\"[BE] Add GET /tasks endpoint that returns all saved tasks\",\"track\":\"backend\",\"area\":\"backend\",\"description\":\"Add a GET /tasks endpoint that reads all saved tasks from the tasks table and returns them with their stored values. If the database is unavailable, return an internal server error response with no task data.\",\"size\":\"S\",\"consumes_api\":false,\"touches_db\":true,\"requirement_ids\":[\"R-4bed9064\",\"R-244669c0\",\"R-9dc414dc\"],\"is_spike\":false,\"definition_of_done\":[\"GET /tasks returns every stored task with its stored values.\",\"GET /tasks returns an internal server error and no task data when the database is unavailable.\",\"Endpoint is covered by unit tests.\"]},{\"key_slug\":\"task-by-id-endpoint\",\"title\":\"[BE] Add GET /tasks/{id} endpoint returning one task or not-found error\",\"track\":\"backend\",\"area\":\"backend\",\"description\":\"Add a GET /tasks/{id} endpoint that returns one saved task with its stored values. If no task has the requested ID, return a not-found error with no task data.\",\"size\":\"S\",\"consumes_api\":false,\"touches_db\":true,\"requirement_ids\":[\"R-244669c0\",\"R-9dc414dc\"],\"is_spike\":false,\"definition_of_done\":[\"GET /tasks/{id} returns one task with its stored values when the ID exists.\",\"GET /tasks/{id} returns a not-found error and no task data when the ID does not exist.\",\"Endpoint is covered by unit tests.\"]},{\"key_slug\":\"task-list-view\",\"title\":\"[FE] Build the task list view on the to-do management page\",\"track\":\"frontend\",\"area\":\"frontend\",\"description\":\"Build the task list view on the to-do management page. Show one row per task from GET /tasks, with a status indicator and a priority indicator in each row.\",\"size\":\"M\",\"consumes_api\":true,\"touches_db\":false,\"requirement_ids\":[\"R-eed06908\",\"R-60e02b8e\",\"R-48c89e9e\"],\"is_spike\":false,\"definition_of_done\":[\"The to-do management page shows the task list with one row per task.\",\"Each row shows a status indicator and a priority indicator with the stored values.\",\"The list shows all stored tasks.\"]},{\"key_slug\":\"task-list-states\",\"title\":\"[FE] Show loading, empty and error states in the task list\",\"track\":\"frontend\",\"area\":\"frontend\",\"description\":\"Show a loading state while the task data is being fetched, an empty state when there are no saved tasks, and an error state when the request fails. The error state shows no task rows and no success state.\",\"size\":\"S\",\"consumes_api\":true,\"touches_db\":false,\"requirement_ids\":[\"R-d7e6667f\"],\"is_spike\":false,\"definition_of_done\":[\"The loading state replaces the list until the data arrives.\",\"The empty state is shown with no task rows when the list loads successfully with no tasks.\",\"The error state is shown with no task rows and no success state when the list request fails.\"]},{\"key_slug\":\"task-list-auto-refresh\",\"title\":\"[FE] Refresh the task list automatically after task changes\",\"track\":\"frontend\",\"area\":\"frontend\",\"description\":\"Refresh the task list from the backend after a task is created, updated, deleted or has its status changed, so the change is visible without a page reload.\",\"size\":\"S\",\"consumes_api\":true,\"touches_db\":false,\"requirement_ids\":[\"R-6a73fa71\"],\"is_spike\":false,\"definition_of_done\":[\"The list refreshes after a task is created, updated, deleted or has its status changed.\",\"The change is visible without a manual page reload.\",\"The list shows only data returned by the backend.\"]},{\"key_slug\":\"task-list-test-suite\",\"title\":\"[QA] Write the test suite for the task list\",\"track\":\"qa_general\",\"area\":\"qa\",\"description\":\"Write the test suite for the task list covering the list display, the status and priority indicators, the loading, empty and error states, the backend read endpoints and the automatic refresh.\",\"size\":\"M\",\"consumes_api\":true,\"touches_db\":false,\"requirement_ids\":[\"R-eed06908\",\"R-4bed9064\",\"R-60e02b8e\",\"R-48c89e9e\",\"R-d7e6667f\",\"R-6a73fa71\",\"R-244669c0\",\"R-9dc414dc\",\"R-d57336f7\"],\"is_spike\":false,\"definition_of_done\":[\"Tests cover every acceptance criterion of the task list story.\",\"Tests cover the list, the indicators, the loading, empty and error states, and the automatic refresh.\",\"The test suite passes in the continuous integration pipeline.\"]}]}",
